# npm pack output
# The installed MCP server is built from this repo and packed here. A tarball
# left in the tree outlives the branch it came from: v1.9.0 was installed from
# one whose source lived only on an unpushed local branch, so a rebuild from
# main would silently have dropped a shipped tool (TEH-4363).
*.tgz
